    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/510becca36848c11efb9937d1006fe60.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cCOROCONNECT&quot; is a multiplayer-only action game. The key to this game is the teamwork! Players use wonder gimmicks to tackle different stages. Synchronized cooperation is essential for success! Team up with friends or online players to clear all the stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/4bfecfe6ad8db250e968a719bed0293b.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;COROCONNECT&quot; is currently in Early Access. We would love to hear your thoughts and feedback! Bug reports, improvement suggestions, and ideas are all welcome. Together, we aim to create an even better game with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/adb9ff2e7ead3b2dd2a89735d7b684f7.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer-only game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 4 players online or locally</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each player's actions are crucial. The unique gameplay requires cooperation with teammates to clear stages.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of gimmicks: Players can freely switch between 4 types of gimmicks, and using the same gimmick can sometimes provide an advantage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging stages: Each stage is meticulously designed to test players' skills and teamwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While COROCONNECT supports Remote Play, please note that only Player 1 (the host player) can use a keyboard and mouse. Players 2-4 must use controllers to participate in the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/510becca36848c11efb9937d1006fe60.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cCOROCONNECT&quot; is a multiplayer-only action game. The key to this game is the teamwork! Players use wonder gimmicks to tackle different stages. Synchronized cooperation is essential for success! Team up with friends or online players to clear all the stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/2a489d4924b261acfd43e95a3ebc751e.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/4bfecfe6ad8db250e968a719bed0293b.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;COROCONNECT&quot; is currently in Early Access. We would love to hear your thoughts and feedback! Bug reports, improvement suggestions, and ideas are all welcome. Together, we aim to create an even better game with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/5ef08bfd4c60d84bf9f654e86dd61f4d.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/adb9ff2e7ead3b2dd2a89735d7b684f7.webp?t=1743668024\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer-only game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 4 players online or locally</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each player's actions are crucial. The unique gameplay requires cooperation with teammates to clear stages.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of gimmicks: Players can freely switch between 4 types of gimmicks, and using the same gimmick can sometimes provide an advantage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging stages: Each stage is meticulously designed to test players' skills and teamwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.poster.avif?t=1743668024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.webm?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729640/extras/6d1c0817e5c514528d3e56935989d52f.mp4?t=1743668024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While COROCONNECT supports Remote Play, please note that only Player 1 (the host player) can use a keyboard and mouse. Players 2-4 must use controllers to participate in the game.</p>",
